      "headline_id": "goal21-crypto-custody-proposal",
      "headline_text": "The Securities and Exchange Commission today proposed new rules and amendments to provide a tailored framework for the custody of crypto assets for registered investment advisers and regulated funds, i.e. registered investment companies and business development companies.",
